<title>UK: London precious metals end quiet day mixed.</title>
<headline>London precious metals end quiet day mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $322.50/$322.90 vs $324.50/$325.00. Eased overnight on fund and producer selling. Little movement thereafter. Some pressure from dollar.</p>
<p>SILVER - Barely moved. $4.29/$4.31, off two cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ended up $3.00 at $419.00/$422.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closed at $201.50/$204.50 up $5.10.</p>
</text>
